    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43449" root="لوى" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِوَآءٌ</span></b>  <i>A banner,</i> or <i>standard,</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَمٌ</span>, (M, Mgh,
K,) <i>of a commander,</i> (T,) or <i>of an army, less than
the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَايَة</span>, <i>being a strip of cloth, twisted,</i> or <i>wound,
and tied to a spear-shaft.</i> (Mgh.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِفَادَةٌ</span>.
Respecting the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِوَآء</span> of the Kaabeh, see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَنَ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَادَةٌ</span>.

